82
00:05:10,382 --> 00:05:18,047
[SPEAKER_00]: When the Buddha talks about understanding the gratification of sensuality, it's that, chanda, the delight, the zeal, the anticipation.

83
00:05:19,127 --> 00:05:21,809
[SPEAKER_00]: It's not the contact with the agreeable object.

84
00:05:22,529 --> 00:05:23,710
[SPEAKER_00]: That's not the gratification.

85
00:05:23,730 --> 00:05:32,415
[SPEAKER_00]: You're already gratifying your sensuality by allowing the anticipation to be first, by accepting it, by welcoming it, by delighting it further.

86
00:05:33,248 --> 00:05:40,552
[SPEAKER_00]: That's the inspiration, the uplifting, the joy towards... that's already your gratification of centrality.

87
00:05:41,232 --> 00:05:47,475
[SPEAKER_00]: And then, everything else that follows through the framework of anticipation, is just proliferation of that gratification.

88
00:05:47,615 --> 00:05:52,438
[SPEAKER_00]: So, that's why it's never-ending, because the framework of anticipation, yeah, can last infinitely.

89
00:05:52,818 --> 00:05:53,919
