109
00:07:11,706 --> 00:07:20,029
[SPEAKER_00]: And then it just becomes absolutely effortless, while in reality, you do much more as a result of that anticipation, nothing else.

110
00:07:20,509 --> 00:07:25,310
[SPEAKER_00]: That's why in some suttas, you know, the Buddha talked about danger of gratification, danger of sensuality.

111
