[SPEAKER_00]: And it's just this effortless inspired zeal that you're just flying weightless on.

123
00:08:32,724 --> 00:08:34,905
[SPEAKER_00]: And that's exactly why sensuality is intoxicating.

124
00:08:34,925 --> 00:08:37,367
